    {
      "uid": "zhcn:332304ab19b22357f929beb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今天和往常不太一样能看出来吗？\n……喂！认真点观察啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c1c38a93dbf857d9c8b5b19614f25479a6b65ae61d45a13654c24eb2be3e4ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bffc9487c46829452d2688be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "指甲和尾巴状态都很完美……\n感觉能跑得很棒♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "f75a517db904f75dce16b45f19e561070789d9f7b80bfc281419ed221b0e65f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b64ec1fcedcd33f3d3821e0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼~哼哼~♪\n哼~哼~哼~哼……♪\n嘿嘿！哼得很棒吧~♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "66ed5153c61941021a608f0932079fbafff91e6a971f654c2de04406b329dee0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85bcaedbb2ab7397991ae5b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练吗？\n明白明白，请便。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55226829d0bf03196b55216e78a56e9211ceffa67b8605c20c7de2e277b9d17d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d8a623c8eb570e20df693d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "急急忙忙就要训练吗~？\n啊，我想先看看Umasta。\n稍等我一下下~",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0e8d57dc8b568435d94f77b7bb3634f6c43723b3c6c9759e79711c6ce0aac1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f45d5572336237bdb51fa7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜溜……感觉肚子有点……\n不对是脑袋有点痛……\n所以说，今天可以休息吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "defa26e59d2ad1852de1e1a474340f053e32d97c0131d7a4b361a9d2144516b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09a3d9b599ad40d8ba644a49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老师——\n状态不好的时候再怎么做~\n也不会有效果的~",
      "source_fingerprint": "abaa3fa21d375edb5e61ac80c4242cc7077ee2a9baaec0835d47c29d7c8474ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49fbe8e4692d0062d917f00c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行。\n做不到。\n背我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55a1248ca33689237e6b2197162767bfb0958e1aca203e5edda42060809e6c1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5d166f64de24f3bfc1c0e7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新的包包~？\n……不需要。\n不想要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f94df5bacafb351062919261f75aeba24deefdb26a1907b779df6570f7180361",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec4e8137881d57a187992ccc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又要比赛……！？\n……诶，是因为照顾我太多\n导致出问题了吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "516e9ceead364e443c104fb0d2408a55429303b43d5b7f1e0cd57d858f9eecc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74aad63e3f319df6a6818720",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再也不随便撒娇要东西再也不挑食，\n再也不上课睡觉了。\n……总之快恢复正常啦啊啊啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fd19759baa06999a30633ae217efd789e0fa8cf041e09fab965e48baea104f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3b8db8f3c08b582ba9b8a7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要成为传说♡\n刻下历史♡\n还请多多关照~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1917b916829b2e534e126fdec35ecf74b938fcb78215219b5f078f0b7bdc58e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9814737dda07d3af4a67c252",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不得了，今天的我不得了。\n说不定，要超越天才，\n要成为神了……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51a61bde822ae8fa6cbd8faa144a7d434c24889e40024fbe7c7795864081d936",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24111d7828383768b1501be2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "伴舞时穿的衣服~？\n不需要不需要♪\n我不可能会在C位之外♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "07cf8c2ff889cf85fedaf30c81f8dd72b7a4969eaf01e8b0cd91357d7de94c50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7511b90ade89eb363317316f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "反正都能稳赢了……\n庆功地点决定好了吗？\n要来决定一下吗~~~！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f832d140277f0c6d02f2a509d43e69cc174e43329824144d38f54c2d05e1b8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5dabf67b7b51e18171ce2b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天赢了的话~\n爸爸妈妈就会给我买新包包♡\n嗯哼哼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7598f7a0e4fd320ee19a859320b50ceaf7a19408428b703c47eb6007627040e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ad8f8f1cb0cc583d2ac91d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好看着吧~~！\n咻地一下啪地一下就能赢啦♡♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "d00326e96e69d5d0deea1201e552bc23802c3ddef88819bed6ccc25948d6c446",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0afdd07c9fea2e52fe287d5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一般都可以的啦~！\n没问题没问题♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "47e14779d18cd6c7a00797a9108ad59c60480da2457adcd316b900a885cd5a22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9232747aa8b5e3d5920b5167",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气势~？不至于要用到这个☆\n在我认真起来之前就能结束比赛♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "675bfcce90da8b965a7816b12c6ab0e0888bac85c14a90b58ff9893299ea98e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc299bd94a01fa4ffa659e02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐好闲啊。\n大家在比赛前都会做什么呢？\n……Umasta？",
      "source_fingerprint": "75d5785a950ab613845ab79792eaf463cf93863c163fbca90ab8c7f4a22e151f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94782882ab888ed14279597a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……知道啦~\n会加油的~",
      "source_fingerprint": "78237e1a25accd253ea7f0a4def0e4fd83934df49313f8d0d2e42e617fa5fd09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e12fc7c5bd2f1706f0cc0141",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶，大家都好认真啊。\n我也得认真起来才行吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dbb74ad44ef29894c7c018061faeb8528d6bc3c9e701a7dfee46038987bcec6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75f57e20690f490392b4ae84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇~……\n嗯？集中？\n有在集中啦~过一会儿就好~",
      "source_fingerprint": "007e50c6eae748ad312659f3800457afd4ee4c947f31a85a11fc72629f8417fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db5579a46a9445f177708094",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行！\n这种状态根本没法跑！\n讨厌讨厌讨厌~~~~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "967975e72e1ce71a09e5dd205a9911977efff06331f27f468bbd04573e340c8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:222dcb8b22a24bb0013cf8f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑起来的话有奖励吗？\n……那我就加油好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6a86328658084cd20f50090e610a504ec71ffee56e0c973b84644639af1a7a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34c09f265ff9032127b25f14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……没问题！我可是天才！\n没问题！没问题！\n……没问题，没问题……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbea5eb17f68f481366966d036aaf0279b635dd485bb6e73fe9145a58dc16355",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
